<title>USA: Omaha cattle fully steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle fully steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were fairly active, prices were fully steady.</p>
<p>Steers - select to mostly choice 2-4 1050-1300 lbs 67.50-68.50. Select 65.00-67.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to largely choice 2-4 950-1200 lbs 67.00-68.50. Select 64.00-67.00.</p>
</text>
